{
    "title": "AutoZone Auto Parts & Repair",
    "description": "With the AutoZone app, it\u2019s easier to take care of your vehicle than ever before.\r\n\r\nOrder the right parts and accessories for your car or truck with just a few taps. Get the parts you need fast with same-day store pick up or convenient ship to home delivery. Track your AutoZone Rewards balance and get information on your local store straight from the home screen. \r\nWith AutoZone on your phone, you're that much closer to getting back on the road. \r\n\r\nBUY ONLINE, PICK UP IN STORE OR SHIP TO YOUR HOME\r\nEasily get the parts you need the same day with store pick up or have them shipped directly to your house.\r\n\r\nSAME DAY DELIVERY\r\nDelivery in 3hrs or less on orders placed by 6PM. Get it fast! Available in select markets.\r\n\r\nSTORE LOCATOR\r\nWith over 6,000 stores across the United States, the Store Locator helps you find the most convenient location no matter where you are. Set your store to see hours and check pricing and availability.\r\n\r\nVIN DECODER\r\nUse the VIN scanner to add your vehicle automatically and find the right parts faster.\r\n\r\nLICENSE PLATE LOOKUP\r\nFind your vehicle by entering your license plate number to retrieve your VIN and add your vehicle.\r\n\r\nBARCODE SCANNER\r\nShopping in store? Use the barcode scanner to check pricing and specifications for any part in the store.\r\n\r\nMANAGE YOUR VEHICLES\r\nKeep track of all of your vehicles in one convenient place. Track every job with the Service History feature, view DIY suggestions with Repair Help and check your vehicle's specifications. \r\n\r\nREWARDS\r\nTrack your AutoZone Rewards balance right on the home screen. Not a member? Sign up today to start earning money for your purchases.",
    "descriptionHTML": "With the AutoZone app, it\u2019s easier to take care of your vehicle than ever before.<br><br>Order the right parts and accessories for your car or truck with just a few taps. Get the parts you need fast with same-day store pick up or convenient ship to home delivery. Track your AutoZone Rewards balance and get information on your local store straight from the home screen. <br>With AutoZone on your phone, you&#39;re that much closer to getting back on the road. <br><br>BUY ONLINE, PICK UP IN STORE OR SHIP TO YOUR HOME<br>Easily get the parts you need the same day with store pick up or have them shipped directly to your house.<br><br>SAME DAY DELIVERY<br>Delivery in 3hrs or less on orders placed by 6PM. Get it fast! Available in select markets.<br><br>STORE LOCATOR<br>With over 6,000 stores across the United States, the Store Locator helps you find the most convenient location no matter where you are. Set your store to see hours and check pricing and availability.<br><br>VIN DECODER<br>Use the VIN scanner to add your vehicle automatically and find the right parts faster.<br><br>LICENSE PLATE LOOKUP<br>Find your vehicle by entering your license plate number to retrieve your VIN and add your vehicle.<br><br>BARCODE SCANNER<br>Shopping in store? Use the barcode scanner to check pricing and specifications for any part in the store.<br><br>MANAGE YOUR VEHICLES<br>Keep track of all of your vehicles in one convenient place. Track every job with the Service History feature, view DIY suggestions with Repair Help and check your vehicle&#39;s specifications. <br><br>REWARDS<br>Track your AutoZone Rewards balance right on the home screen. Not a member? Sign up today to start earning money for your purchases.",
